{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37341","headline":"拜越公墓因游定水寺有怀源老 · 唐彦谦","name":"拜越公墓因游定水寺有怀源老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越公已作飞仙去，犹得潭潭好墓田。\n老树背风深拓地，野云依海细分天。\n青峰晓接鸣钟寺，玉井秋澄试茗泉。\n我与源公旧相识，遗言潇洒有人传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}